'''Battlemage''' is a [[keyword]]. Battlemage gives the player character {{c|help|Gain Added Spell Damage equal to the Damage of Your Main Hand Weapon}}.
==Mechanics==
* '''Battlemage''' stacks with {{il|Spellblade Support}}.
* It can only add damage to [[spell]]s that deal [[spell damage]]. It cannot add damage to [[Herald]]s.

